<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Titan Growth</ansi> mutation

Your frame swells past any natural bound. You tower, and there is
simply more of you to endure a fight — but a target this large is
hard to miss.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Toughens your body, deepening your reserves of health

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slows your reflexes — your sheer size makes blows easier to land
  on you

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Hollow Bones

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
